; Smaragd Dash demo cave 1: rocks and earth (tools/democave.py plays it, with
; 1-rocks-and-earth.moves; tools/record-tour.sh films it).
;
; Top row, left to right, display cases that Rockford opens from below as he
; walks by (a snap upwards): boulders and emeralds pour out; boulders slide
; off sloped brick, steel and dirt, to the right and to the left; a boulder
; rolls off brick but stays on smooth brick; glued boulders and emeralds
; stay; loose dirt and a dirt ball fall.
; Middle row, right to left: a falling wall drops when Rockford is below
; it; a boulder cracks a nut into an emerald; dirt2, eatable brick and steel,
; a clock (more time); a boulder pushed over a gap falls through the magic
; wall and comes out as an emerald; after the sweet the mega boulder can be
; pushed (into a pit); a box is pushed with fire, to the left and down into
; its pocket; a flying boulder pushed under a shaft rises; a flying emerald
; hangs at the ceiling.
; Bottom row: emeralds, and a waiting boulder that turns into a chasing one.
